#: includes/class-abilities.php:140
msgid "Reads every redirect rule of the active redirect plugins, follows each one to where it ends, and stores the result. Returns the health score (0–100), counts per issue type and severity, and the most severe issues with their redirect path and a suggested fix. Never returns who ran a scan or any other user data, and never changes a redirect rule."
